    "summary": "Child&#039;s hat woven from handspun indigo-dyed cotton with tie-dyed circle at top. Hat has pointed top and triangular ear-flaps. Decorated with cream-coloured synthetic wool pompoms along front and back edges and at each side of flaps. Single indigo-dyed cotton pompom at top of hat. Hand embroidered in green, white, yellow and red synthetic wool on lower half of hat. Flaps edged with twisted cotton or synthetic wool yarn. Long twisted indigo-dyed cotton ties attached to each flap terminating in single indigo-dyed cotton pompom. Seams machine-stitched.",
